	(text "Place separate 100nF at VDD, VIO, VDDA and each oscillator.\n5V budget: up to 70mA per active CAN channel.\nTXD/RXD loop nets connect controller to integrated transceiver."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 243.84 252.73 0)
		(effects
