		(uuid "538a88b3-fe36-43f3-a9c1-06e10617a1a0")
	)
	(text_box "Pico module power: The Pico has an internal regulator that produces 3.3V from VSYS (1.8–5.5V input). For stack operation, feed +5V from the CSKB bus to VSYS through a Schottky diode (prevents back-feeding when USB is also connected)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
